Subject: [PATCH] Tests of the views: integration types, speed of sound, model,
 energies

- EnergyTest behaviour, computing the stored and the dissipated energies.
- each execution on a view starts from a copy of the manager before its
  execution, so that a function which computes nothing is detected.
- all the integration types, predictions included; speed of sound;
  model (empty groups of gradients and thermodynamic forces); energies;
  integrate_debug on views; initialize functions and post-processings
  with the synchronous and asynchronous policies, with and without inputs,
  on ranges; empty sets; views without tangent operator blocks.
